{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>YHWH yireh</b> with a paseq, to tell you that he called the name of the place YHWH. And this is what the Sages said: even a new name that the Holy One, blessed be He, is destined to renew for Jerusalem, he knew. And this is what is stated: 'and the name of the city from the day of YHWH [is] its name.'" "<b>בהר ה'</b> Three times in the Masorah: in the Tanakh: in the Torah — בהר ה'; in the Prophets — לבא בהר ה'; in the Writings — מי יעלה בהר ה'. Corresponding to the three pilgrimage festivals, when they go up to the mountain of YHWH for the festival."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:38.885659620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}